11. STRATEGIC ALIGNMENT
======================================================================

Architecture should be presented differently depending on leadership's
business priority.


CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE PRIORITY
----------------------------------------------------------------------

"Our multi-agent orchestration uses specialized agents for different
domains instead of relying entirely on one general-purpose agent.

The goal is greater consistency and better handling of specialized
customer requests."


----------------------------------------------------------------------

COST REDUCTION PRIORITY
----------------------------------------------------------------------

"Our hybrid architecture uses managed capabilities for commodity
functions and custom development only where differentiation is
important.

This allows engineering investment to focus on areas that provide
business value."


----------------------------------------------------------------------

INNOVATION LEADERSHIP PRIORITY
----------------------------------------------------------------------

"Our specialized-agent architecture supports complex multi-step
workflows by assigning different responsibilities to different
agents.

This can create capabilities that are difficult to maintain using
one increasingly complex general-purpose agent."


