13. WHY ANALOGIES WORK
======================================================================

Analogies convert:

Unfamiliar Technical Concept
            |
            v
Familiar Business Concept


Instead of explaining technical implementation details first,
connect the concept to something stakeholders already understand.


======================================================================
14. COMMUNICATING UNCERTAINTY
======================================================================

WRONG APPROACH:

"Our AI system will be 100% accurate and never fail."


RIGHT APPROACH:

"AI systems can produce unpredictable results.

Our architecture manages that uncertainty through controls such as:

- Guardrails
- Input validation
- Drift detection
- Edge-case handling
- Controlled fallback
- Human escalation

We cannot eliminate every failure scenario, but we can design the
system to detect and manage them."


Key Principle:

Do not sell perfection.

Sell controlled and measurable risk.


