20. TRANSLATION FORMULA
======================================================================

Use this formula when explaining any architectural decision:

TECHNICAL CHOICE
        +
WHY WE NEED IT
        +
BUSINESS IMPACT
        +
MEASURABLE VALUE
        +
TRADE-OFF


Example:

"We selected a multi-agent architecture

because different business capabilities require specialized processing.

This improves modularity and allows capabilities to evolve more
independently.

The business benefit is potentially faster feature delivery and
lower long-term rework.

The trade-off is greater upfront development and orchestration
complexity."


