23. ROI AND PAYBACK
======================================================================

ROI Formula:

ROI =
(
    Benefit - Cost
)
/
Cost
x 100


Example:

Investment = $200K
Business Benefit = $500K

ROI:

($500K - $200K) / $200K x 100

= 150%


----------------------------------------------------------------------

PAYBACK PERIOD

Formula:

Payback Period
=
Initial Investment / Monthly Savings


Example:

Investment:
$200K

Monthly Savings:
$50K

Payback:

$200K / $50K
=
4 months


